  "description": "Fast longest-prefix-match lookups for IPv4 and IPv6: find the most specific stored network that contains an address or a network. Works with System.Net.IPNetwork or your own network type. Reads take no locks while writes run, single lookups allocate nothing, and frozen tables make read-only data faster still. No dependencies.",
